in model-checker.maude
fmod PLEXIL-V--MODEL-CHECKER--BASE is
  protecting PLEXIL .
  protecting COMPILER .
  protecting INTERFACE .
  protecting GENERATORS--BASIC .
  protecting MODEL-CHECKER .

  subsort GlobalConfig < State .
endfm

view Formula from TRIV to PLEXIL-V--MODEL-CHECKER--BASE is
  sort Elt to Formula .
endv